# --- data that must NOT be published ------------------------------------------
# De-identified clinical database: 28 PD patients x 65 clinical variables.
# Small cell sizes make it potentially re-identifiable; k-anonymity has not been
# assessed. Figure 8 depends on it, so that figure cannot be regenerated by
# third parties. Available from the corresponding author on reasonable request.
data/deidentified_clinical_consolidated.xlsx

# Raw physiological recordings are held in the per-centre repositories and are
# covered by the contributing centres' data-sharing agreements.
data/raw/

